[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ふう……なんとか片付いたわね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Phew... looks like we managed to clean up here."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんな、お疲れさま！\u3000ベップちゃんも良くやったわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Good work, everyone! Well done, Bepp!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "すごいわ！\u3000さすがヤンネさん！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "You were amazing, Lady Janne!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｃ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen C"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "さすが、神聖国最強！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's Nova's strongest warrior for you!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "住民Ｄ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citizen D"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なーんだ、もう片付いちゃったのか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Aww, it's already over?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "げぇっ。シトリン……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ugh. Citrine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんでも屋の稼ぎ時かと思って来てみたら……\nヤンネさんがいるなら元から出る幕なしだったなぁ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I came thinking this would be a prime opportunity for business...\nBut with Lady Janne here, I never stood a chance."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうそう！\nなんでも屋なんてお呼びじゃないんだからね！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That's right! We don't need any handypeople here!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……ところで、なんで君がここに？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...By the way, why are you even here?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "シトリン",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Citrine"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そうね。その辺り、じっくり聞かせてもらうわよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Indeed. I'd like to hear all about that."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "うっ。ごめんなさい、その話はまた今度ー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Urk. Sorry, we'll talk about that later!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "アルビーナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alvina"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……もう",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Good grief."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ヤンネ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Janne"
        }
      }
    }
  }
